WEBVTT

00:08:58.596 --> 00:09:01.076
by being a demanding customer.

00:09:01.636 --> 00:09:06.836
When the key strength of markets
is their adaptability

00:09:06.836 --> 00:09:08.836
and when you play to that strength,

00:09:08.876 --> 00:09:13.516
it is surprising how much
you can change in a short time.

00:09:13.876 --> 00:09:16.836
We plan to gradually
introduce requirements

00:09:16.876 --> 00:09:21.196
for zero emissions in all construction
sites in the city of Oslo,

00:09:21.236 --> 00:09:24.156
both private and public, by 2030.

00:09:24.996 --> 00:09:29.996
In the last years, the city’s quality
of air has improved significantly.